# Vendored trees under contrib/ are deployed byte-for-byte into the projects they come from,
# and the two sides are compared by hash. core.autocrlf=true would rewrite LF to CRLF on the
# next checkout, so the comparison would fail on a fresh clone even though nothing in the
# source changed. -text turns every EOL conversion off for these paths: the bytes in the index
# are the bytes on disk, on every platform.
#
# This is scoped to contrib/ on purpose. The rest of the repository keeps the normal
# autocrlf behaviour, which is what the Windows working copies expect.
contrib/hfhis-cache/skills/** -text
contrib/hfhis-cache/mcp/** -text
